      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start, it's very academic. I want to lean more into the idea that the opposing group's views aren't just different, but actually rooted in a kind of cognitive failure or emotional insecurity. Can you write another version that's a bit punchier? Maybe focus on how their ideology acts like a blindfold that prevents them from engaging with reality?",
